        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "MOSES may post notices on bulletin boards or an adequate part thereof in places and locations where notices usually are posted by the Employer for employees to read. All notices shall be on MOSES stationery, signed by an official of MOSES, and shall only be used to notify employees of matters pertaining to MOSES affairs. The notices may remain posted for a reasonable period of time. No material shall be posted",
